{"suttaId":"pv6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[97,125],"vripara":"26"},"segments":{"pv6:0.3":"Pañcaputtakhādapetivatthu","pv6:1.1":"“Naggā dubbaṇṇarūpāsi, duggandhā pūti vāyasi;","pv6:1.3":"Makkhikāhi parikiṇṇā [makkhikāparikiṇṇā ca (sī.)], kā nu tvaṃ idha tiṭṭhasī”ti.","pv6:2.1":"“Ahaṃ bhadante [bhaddante (ka.)] petīmhi, duggatā yamalokikā;","pv6:2.3":"Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā.","pv6:3.1":"“Kālena pañca puttāni, sāyaṃ pañca punāpare;","pv6:3.3":"Vijāyitvāna khādāmi, tepi nā honti me alaṃ.","pv6:4.1":"“Pariḍayhati dhūmāyati, khudāya [khuddāya (ka.)] hadayaṃ mama;","pv6:4.3":"Pānīyaṃ na labhe pātuṃ, passa maṃ byasanaṃ gatan”ti.","pv6:5.1":"“Kiṃ nu kāyena vācāya, manasā dukkaṭaṃ kataṃ;","pv6:5.3":"Kissa kammavipākena, puttamaṃsāni khādasī”ti.","pv6:6.1":"“Sapatī [sapattī (sī.)] me gabbhinī āsi, tassā pāpaṃ acetayiṃ;","pv6:6.3":"Sāhaṃ paduṭṭhamanasā, akariṃ gabbhapātanaṃ.","pv6:7.1":"“Tassā dvemāsiko gabbho, lohitaññeva pagghari;","pv6:7.3":"Tadassā mātā kupitā, mayhaṃ ñātī samānayi;","pv6:7.5":"Sapathañca maṃ kāresi, paribhāsāpayī ca maṃ.","pv6:8.1":"“Sāhaṃ ghorañca sapathaṃ, musāvādaṃ abhāsisaṃ;","pv6:8.3":"Puttamaṃsāni khādāmi, sace taṃ pakataṃ mayā.","pv6:9.1":"“Tassa kammassa vipākena [vipākaṃ (syā. ka.)], musāvādassa cūbhayaṃ;","pv6:9.3":"Puttamaṃsāni khādāmi, pubbalohitamakkhitā”ti.","pv6:10.1":"Pañcaputtakhādapetivatthu [pañcaputtakhādapetavatthu (sī. syā. pī.) evamuparipi] chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":209,"to":244,"paras":[{"para":209,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv6:1"],"words":["naggā","dubbaṇṇarūpāsī","duggandhā","pūti vāyasī","makkhikāhi parikiṇṇā","kā nu tvaṃ idha tiṭṭhasī"],"lines":["Gāthāya paṭipucchi.","Tattha <b>naggā</b>ti niccoḷā.","<b>Dubbaṇṇarūpāsī</b>ti ṇavirūpā ativiya bībhaccharūpena samannāgatā asi.","<b>Duggandhā</b>ti aniṭṭhagandhā.","<b>Pūti vāyasī</b>ti sarīrato kuṇapagandhaṃ vāyasi.","<b>Makkhikāhi parikiṇṇā</b>ti nīlamakkhikāhi samantato ākiṇṇā.","<b>Kā nu tvaṃ idha tiṭṭhasī</b>ti kā nāma evarūpā imasmiṃ ṭhāne tiṭṭhasi, ito cito ca vicarasīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:1"],["pv6:1"],["pv6:1"],["pv6:1"],["pv6:1"],["pv6:1"],["pv6:1"]]},{"para":210,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Atha sā petī mahātherena evaṃ puṭṭhā attānaṃ pakāsentī sattānaṃ saṃvegaṃ janentī –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":212,"vripara":"27","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Ahaṃ bhadante petīmhi, duggatā yamalokikā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":213,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":215,"vripara":"28","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Kālena pañca puttāni, sāyaṃ pañca punāpare;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":216,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Vijāyitvāna khādāmi, tepi nā honti me alaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":218,"vripara":"29","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Pariḍayhati dhūmāyati, khudāya hadayaṃ mama;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":219,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pānīyaṃ na labhe pātuṃ, passa maṃ byasanaṃ gatan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":220,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Imā tisso gāthā abhāsi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":221,"vripara":"27","refs":["pv6:2"],"words":["bhadante","duggatā","yamalokikā","ito gatā"],"lines":["Tattha <b>bhadante</b>ti theraṃ gāravena ālapati.","<b>Duggatā</b>ti duggatiṃ gatā.","<b>Yamalokikā</b>ti “yamaloko”ti laddhanāme petaloke tattha pariyāpannabhāvena viditā.","<b>Ito gatā</b>ti ito manussalokato petalokaṃ upapajjanavasena gatā, upapannāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:2"],["pv6:2"],["pv6:2"],["pv6:2"]]},{"para":222,"vripara":"28","refs":["pv6:3"],"words":["kālenā","pañca puttānī","sāyaṃ pañca punāpare","vijāyitvānā","tepi nā honti me alaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Kālenā</b>ti rattiyā vibhātakāle.","Bhummatthe hi etaṃ karaṇavacanaṃ.","<b>Pañca puttānī</b>ti pañca putte.","Liṅgavipallāsena hetaṃ vuttaṃ.","<b>Sāyaṃ pañca punāpare</b>ti sāyanhakāle puna apare pañca putte khādāmīti yojanā.","<b>Vijāyitvānā</b>ti divase divase dasa dasa putte vijāyitvā.","<b>Tepi nā honti me alan</b>ti tepi dasaputtā ekadivasaṃ mayhaṃ khudāya paṭighātāya ahaṃ pariyattā na honti.","Gāthāsukhatthañhettha nā-iti dīghaṃ katvā vuttaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"],["pv6:3"]]},{"para":223,"vripara":"29","refs":["pv6:4"],"words":["pariḍayhati dhūmāyati khudāya hadayaṃ mamā","pānīyaṃ na labhe pātuṃ","passa maṃ byasanaṃ gataṃ"],"lines":["<b>Pariḍayhati dhūmāyati khudāya hadayaṃ mamā</b>ti khudāya jighacchāya bādhiyamānāya mama hadayapadeso udaragginā parisamantato jhāyati dhūmāyati santappati.","<b>Pānīyaṃ na labhe pātun</b>ti pipāsābhibhūtā tattha tattha vicarantī pānīyampi pātuṃ na labhāmi.","<b>Passa maṃ byasanaṃ gatan</b>ti petūpapattiyā sādhāraṇaṃ asādhāraṇañca imaṃ īdisaṃ byasanaṃ upagataṃ maṃ passa, bhanteti attanā anubhaviyamānaṃ dukkhaṃ therassa pavedesi."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:4"],["pv6:4"],["pv6:4"]]},{"para":224,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Taṃ sutvā thero tāya katakammaṃ pucchanto –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":226,"vripara":"30","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Kiṃ nu kāyena vācāya, manasā dukkaṭaṃ kataṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":227,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Kissa kammavipākena, puttamaṃsāni khādasī”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":228,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv6:5"],"words":["dukkaṭaṃ","kissa kammavipākenā"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>dukkaṭan</b>ti duccaritaṃ.","<b>Kissa kammavipākenā</b>ti kīdisassa kammassa vipākena, kiṃ pāṇātipātassa, udāhu adinnādānādīsu aññatarassāti attho.","“Kena kammavipākenā”ti keci paṭhanti."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:5"],["pv6:5"],["pv6:5"],["pv6:5"]]},{"para":229,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Atha sā petī attanā katakammaṃ therassa kathentī –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":231,"vripara":"31","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Sapatī me gabbhinī āsi, tassā pāpaṃ acetayiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":232,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Sāhaṃ paduṭṭhamanasā, akariṃ gabbhapātanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":234,"vripara":"32","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Tassa dvemāsiko gabbho, lohitaññeva pagghari;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":235,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tadassā mātā kupitā, mayhaṃ ñātī samānayi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":236,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Sapathañca maṃ akāresi, paribhāsāpayī ca maṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":238,"vripara":"33","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Sāhaṃ ghorañca sapathaṃ, musāvādaṃ abhāsisaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":239,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["‘Puttamaṃsāni khādāmi, sace taṃ pakataṃ mayā’."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":241,"vripara":"34","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Tassa kammassa vipākena, musāvādassa cūbhayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":242,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Puttamaṃsāni khādāmi, pubbalohitamakkhitā”ti.","– gāthāyo abhāsi;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":243,"vripara":"31-32","refs":["pv6:6"],"words":["sapatī","tassā pāpaṃ acetayiṃ","paduṭṭhamanasā"],"lines":["31-32. Tattha <b>sapatī</b>ti samānapatikā itthī vuccati.","<b>Tassā pāpaṃ acetayin</b>ti tassa sapatiyā pāpaṃ luddakaṃ kammaṃ acetayiṃ.","<b>Paduṭṭhamanasā</b>ti paduṭṭhacittā, paduṭṭhena vā manasā.","<b>Dvemāsiko</b>ti dvemāsajāto patiṭṭhito hutvā dvemāsikā.","<b>Lohitaññeva paggharī</b>ti vipajjamāno ruhiraññeva hutvā vissandi.","<b>Tadassā mātā kupitā, mayhaṃ ñātī samānayī</b>ti tadā assā sapatiyā mātā mayhaṃ kupitā attano ñātake samodhānesi.","“Tatassā”ti vā pāṭho, tato assāti padavibhāgo."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:6"],["pv6:6"],["pv6:6"],["pv6:6"],["pv6:6"],["pv6:6"],["pv6:6"]]},{"para":244,"vripara":"33-34","refs":["pv6:8"],"words":["sapathaṃ","sapathaṃ musāvādaṃ abhāsisaṃ"],"lines":["33-34. <b>Sapathan</b>ti sapanaṃ.","<b>Paribhāsāpayī</b>ti bhayena tajjāpesi.","<b>Sapathaṃ musāvādaṃ abhāsisan</b>ti “sace taṃ mayā kataṃ, īdisī bhaveyyan”ti katameva pāpaṃ akataṃ katvā dassentī musāvādaṃ abhūtaṃ sapathaṃ abhāsiṃ.","<b>Muttamaṃsāni khādāmi, sacetaṃ pakataṃ mayā</b>ti idaṃ tadā sapathassa katākāradassanaṃ.","Yadi etaṃ gabbhapātanapāpaṃ mayā kataṃ, āyatiṃ punabbhavābhinibbattiyaṃ mayhaṃ puttamaṃsāniyeva khādeyyanti attho.","<b>Tassa kammassā</b>ti tassa gabbhapātanavasena pakatassa pāṇātipātakammassa.","<b>Musāvādassa cā</b>ti musāvādakammassa ca.","<b>Ubhayan</b>ti ubhayassapi kammassa ubhayena vipākena.","Karaṇatthe hi idaṃ paccattavacanaṃ.","<b>Pubbalohitamakkhitā</b>ti pasavanavasena paribhijjanavasena ca pubbena ca lohitena ca makkhitā hutvā puttamaṃsāni khādāmīti yojanā."],"lineRefs":[["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"],["pv6:8"]]}]},"tika":null}
